// .stignore - what Syncthing never carries to another machine (slot Root_141_Stignore).
// Syncthing does not sync this file itself: change it on BOTH ends, same text.

// made on each machine
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.pyc
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d).venv
(?d)node_modules
(?d).stversions

// run data, exports, secrets, per-machine config
data
exports
.vault
*.local.*

// guard state of this machine (one-use flags, read tracking)
docs/.harness-state

// below: the allow list, written by `zemory sync` from every vm_deploy.json — only what automation on the VM uses travels
// zemory:stignore-allow:start · written by `zemory sync` from every vm_deploy.json (slot Root_141_Stignore) — do not edit by hand
// only what automation on the VM uses travels; everything else stays on the work PC
*
// zemory:stignore-allow:end
